on InitieraAutoLage
  [  0] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  1] setglobal 4 ............................. SpeletSlut = 0
  [  3] pushint8 4 .............................. <4>
  [  6] pusharglist 1 ........................... <4>
  [  8] extcall 44 .............................. <random(4)>
  [ 11] setglobal 103 ........................... AktivAutoSpik = random(4)
  [ 14] ret
end
